"text": "v030-14's acceptance needs CI: the windows and macOS readings exist only on `matrix_test`'s «Test (windows)» and «Test (macos)» jobs, and the linux one on the `test` leg; so the plan carries the operator's hygiene, push and CI-read entries, the CI read asserting `verdict: green`. «Stand checks repeated» runs both new `stand_` files three rounds (the glob, test-plan `decision/stand-checks-repeated-three-rounds`). No dependency and no production code change, so the audit and coverage legs are no local entry: CI runs them and the CI read covers them."
}
